{"id":843383,"title":"结束语","content":"本课程涵盖数字人技术的入门、企业应用原因、定制方法及应用场景，包括视频制作与交互设计。通过11讲内容，旨在使学习者成为数字人领域的专家或至少熟悉该技术。课程强调了将数字人作为工具应用于个人品牌建设或企业获客的重要性，以及利用人工智能提高工作效率、减少重复劳动的价值。最终目标是让参与者能够创建满意的数字人，并在实际场景中发挥其价值，推动人工智能技术深入各行各业。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400286,"user_name":"水木","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1288226,"ip_address":"广西","ucode":"30E935000F36C6","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/a8/22/09c4211e.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1747234008,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100856601,"comment_content":"我也看完了，他这课程并没有从技术角度去讲解AI数字人制作的原理（如：AI驱动嘴唇同步口音）与技术实现……","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1378499,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/08/c3/cafedf10.jpg","nickname":"春天","note":"","ucode":"4F26D81ED4D05A","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":662426,"discussion_content":"是的。其实还是更关心技术实现原理","content_length":16,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1749004738,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":397829,"user_name":"MClink","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1435733,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"F479190923355C","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/15/e8/55/63189817.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1739694908,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100856601,"comment_content":"看完了，只能说是理论学习和实操实践（非开发视角）","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":398209,"user_name":"雪候鸟","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1698291,"ip_address":"江西","ucode":"3E7ED6605BC86E","user_